  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uganda Budget Support - This project has been indefinitely suspended</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the delivery of public services by providing general and health sector budget support needed to help attain growth and poverty reduction, and to deliver quality health services to 940, 600 people (102,700 more births attended by skilled workers, 124,700 children immunised and 713,200 children receive malaria treatment) in Uganda.  This will contribute to the achievement of the MDGs by increasing efficient and equitable use of oil and domestic revenues especially those related to health, education and water by 2015.</narrative>
  </description>
